<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia's TCV to offer A$100 mln 2001 stock.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia's TCV to offer A$100 mln 2001 stock.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Treasury Corporation of Victoria (TCV) said it will offer A$100 million of 12 percent September 2001 stock at Monday's tender.  </p>
<p>The tender is scheduled for 10.30 a.m. local time (0030 GMT) and the result should be known shortly afterwards.</p>
<p>TCV is the borrowing arm of the state of Victoria.</p>
<p>--Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
